SUMMARY:August long weekend camping trip 
DESCRIPTION:Hiking Network\nAnyone up for a long weekend camping by the Gi
 bson river.\nTo find the trail head drive up the 400 HYY about 20 min. pas
 t port Severn.\nUse turn off 177 for go home lake.\nTake the left ( west) 
 in about a half km. You will see a community water pump on the right.\nDon
 't park in that lot! use the lot just before it.\nThe trail head is across
  from the pump.\nIts about a two hour hike down to the river.\nBring campi
 ng gear\, food\, bug spray\, swimming suit.\nPlan to chill by the river fo
 r two days.\nBring a cook stove if you have one the fire ban may be on!
